title: Infoblox: Security policy
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports an Infoblox Threat Defense security policy: its rule count,
 default action, the protection options enabled on it, how many DNS
 forwarding proxies are bound to it, and its precedence.

 The expected default action can be asserted, and the check goes to a
 configurable state when the policy still references legacy threat feeds.

 This endpoint returns configuration rather than health. The health of the
 DNS Forwarding Proxy itself comes from the per server deployed service
 check.

discovery:
 One service is created per security policy in the tenant, on the tenant
 host. Only present when the tenant is licensed for Threat Defense.

item:
 The policy name as configured in the portal.
